#* {{RQ:Tasso Fairfax Godfrey of Bulloigne|18|stanza=26|320|And from his fertill hollow wombe forth ran, <br> (Clad in rare weedes and ſtrange habiliment) <br> A Nymph, for age able to goe to man, <br> An hundreth plants beſide (euen in his ſight) <br> '''Childed''' an hundreth Nymphes, ſo great, ſo dight:{{...}}}}
#* {{RQ:Shakespeare King Lear Q1|act=III|scene=v|passage={{...}}But then the mind much ſufferance doth or'e ſcip, <br> When griefe hath mates,&ZeroWidthSpace;and bearing fellowſhip&nbsp;: <br> How light and portable my paine ſeemes now, <br> When that which makes me bend, makes the King bow, <br> He '''childed''' as I fathered,&ZeroWidthSpace;''Tom'' away, <br> Marke the high noyſes and thy ſelfe bewray,{{...}}}}

